Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.74,0:02:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,她干脆把自己比作自家那栋房子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.53,0:02:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,她写 每回她和妹妹冲下楼\N房子的肚子就翻江倒海
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她们从后门出去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.30,0:02:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,房子看着她们穿过围栏\N抄近路奔向马路
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.74,0:02:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,然后淡出了视线
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.08,0:02:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,她好奇 房子是更喜欢\N空荡轻盈的样子？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.48,0:03:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,还是更爱有人在时\N那种沉甸甸的感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.61,0:03:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,地板喜不喜欢被踩？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.83,0:03:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,墙会不会痒？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.26,0:03:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,房子会不会痛？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.38,0:03:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,她觉得房子还是更喜欢有人气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,很多人和宠物都在这房子里生活过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,曾曾祖父去世的那间屋\N也是祖母的出生地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.55,0:03:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,现在那间屋是她父母的卧室
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你从不关心我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.77,0:03:46.81,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx100\fscy100\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5\3c&H715C8C&\pos(751,772)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.81,0:03:46.85,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx104.45\fscy104.45\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.22\3c&H715C8C&\pos(763.3,776.18)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.85,0:03:46.89,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx104.79\fscy104.79\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.24\3c&H715C8C&\pos(766.66,777.99)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.89,0:03:46.93,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx104.91\fscy104.91\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.25\3c&H715C8C&\pos(770.66,780.3)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.93,0:03:46.97,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx105.01\fscy105.01\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.25\3c&H715C8C&\pos(776.69,780.97)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.95,0:03:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,还能不能一起过了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.97,0:03:47.02,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx105.25\fscy105.25\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.26\3c&H715C8C&\pos(783.01,779.92)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:47.06,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx105.3\fscy105.3\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.27\3c&H715C8C&\pos(788.87,777.61)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:47.10,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx106.01\fscy106.01\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.3\3c&H715C8C&\pos(794.32,776.28)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.10,0:03:47.14,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx106.5\fscy106.5\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.32\3c&H715C8C&\pos(799.31,774.43)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.14,0:03:47.18,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx106.74\fscy106.74\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.34\3c&H715C8C&\pos(803.2,772.81)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:47.22,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx107.17\fscy107.17\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.36\3c&H715C8C&\pos(807.19,771.34)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:47.27,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx107.5\fscy107.5\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.38\3c&H715C8C&\pos(811.3,769.51)}诺娜
