Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.31,0:03:47.35,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx108.56\fscy108.56\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.43\3c&H715C8C&\pos(819.05,764.32)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.35,0:03:47.39,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx108.89\fscy108.89\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.44\3c&H715C8C&\pos(823.06,761.97)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.39,0:03:47.43,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx109.27\fscy109.27\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.46\3c&H715C8C&\pos(826.84,759.63)}诺娜
